          %h2#Definition Definition
          %p We now turn to the formal definition of higher Atiyah groupoids and the basic constructions on them.
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
