            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+2-algebra"} Lie 2-algebra
            of sections of the corresponding
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Courant+Lie+2-algebroid"} Courant Lie 2-algebroid
            observed in (
            %a{:href => "#Rogers10"}> Rogers 10
            ).
          %h3#TheTraditionalQuantomorphismGroup The traditional quantomorphism group
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
