                            %mi n
                            %mo −
                            %mn 1
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mi ℝ
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{H}(X, \flat (\mathbf{B}^{n-1})\mathbb{R})
                  is the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/chain+complex"} chain complex
                  for flat
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/de+Rham+cohomology"} de Rham cohomology
                  in the given degree, regarded as an abelian
                  = succeed "." do
